= Aleksandr Potresov

Potresov has been a Social Democrat since the Emancipation of Labor group was founded. A long-time editor of Iskra, and now Novaya Zhizn, he is a die-hard reformist and anti-Bolshevik.

- @coalition
- @prussian_bulwark
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Potresov can improve our relationships with our centrist and center-right coalition partners in Prussia as well as in the Reichstag.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (rsdrp_prussia or in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not rsdrp_prussia : The RSDRP does not control the Prussian government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if rsdrp_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; psr_relation += 6; musavat_relation += 6; kadets_relation += 2; kadets_relation += 3 if in_grand_coalition

We have improved our relations with the [? if in_grand_coalition : Center (Zentrum) Party, [+ musavat_name +], and DVP, ?][? if not in_grand_coalition: Center (Zentrum) Party and [+ musavat_name +], ?] and reduced tensions with the coalition.

@prussian_bulwark
title: The Prussian Bulwark
subtitle: As the Minister-President of Prussia, Potresov has power over the Prussian bureaucracy and security services.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and rsdrp_prussia = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if rsdrp_prussia == 0 : The RSDRP does not control Prussia. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; prussian_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: prussian_affairs

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Braun" and president != "Braun" : Potresov must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if president = "Braun" and presidential_powers : We have removed this power from the president with a constitutional reform. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Braun" or (president == "Braun" and not presidential_powers))
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; 

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
